WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.150
After the Belt of the Most Holy Mother of God, a part of the Honorable Cross is coming to Belgrade from Mount Athos.

2
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:12.810
A part of the Honorable Cross of the Lord, which Holy Prince Lazar gave to the Vatopedi monastery on Mount Athos, is arriving in Belgrade soon.

3
00:00:12.810 --> 00:00:18.280
This joyful news was announced by Patriarch Porfirije after a conversation with the abbot of Vatopedi.

4
00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:28.280
The arrival of this holy relic in the Serbian capital follows the huge response of believers, who in May welcomed the Honorable Belt of the Most Holy Mother of God in the Temple of Saint Sava.
